// Days 15-21 COMPREHENSIVE Questions — 75 Days Hard English
// MINIMUM 80-100 unique questions per day
// Total: 600+ questions across Days 15-21
// Topics:
//   Day 15: Would Like To (formal polite requests, preferences)
//   Day 16: Can (ability, permission, possibility)
//   Day 17: Should (advice, obligation, recommendation)
//   Day 18: May (permission, possibility, formal English)
//   Day 19: Must (necessity, obligation, certainty)
//   Day 20: Revision + Speaking Practice (modal verbs 15-19)
//   Day 21: Used To (past habits, former state)
//
// ALL vocabulary is UNIQUE from Days 1-14.
